WEBVTT

00:00:05.264 --> 00:00:06.349
(sighs)

00:00:06.432 --> 00:00:08.142
You were a good parent, Sid.

00:00:08.226 --> 00:00:09.644
Thanks.

00:00:10.311 --> 00:00:11.562
Can I babysit for you?

00:00:11.646 --> 00:00:12.605
Not a chance.

00:00:12.689 --> 00:00:13.898
Oh, come on, I work cheap.

00:00:13.981 --> 00:00:15.858
All right, I'll think about it.

00:00:15.942 --> 00:00:16.818
(sighs)

00:00:16.901 --> 00:00:17.902
Yes!

00:00:17.985 --> 00:00:19.779
Never happen.

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:25.118
He's gone.

00:00:25.201 --> 00:00:27.203
What am I supposed to do now?

00:00:27.286 --> 00:00:28.454
ELLIE:
That's easy.

00:00:28.538 --> 00:00:30.915
Come with us.

00:00:30.998 --> 00:00:33.668
You mean... up there?

00:00:33.751 --> 00:00:35.128
Huh.

00:00:35.211 --> 00:00:37.213
I never thought of going back.

00:00:37.296 --> 00:00:40.466
I've been down here so long,
it feels like up to me.

00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:42.885
I'm not sure I can fit
in up there anymore.

00:00:42.969 --> 00:00:45.138
DIEGO:
So? Look at us.

00:00:45.221 --> 00:00:47.223
We look like a normal herd to you?

00:00:48.057 --> 00:00:50.268
(clicking claws) Ow!

00:00:55.481 --> 00:00:57.483
♪ ♪

00:01:04.532 --> 00:01:06.075
(chuckling)

00:01:06.159 --> 00:01:08.119
(Sid panting heavily)

00:01:16.252 --> 00:01:18.212
So long, big guy.

00:01:25.136 --> 00:01:27.138
(roaring in distance)

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:32.018
That's our cue.
Come on, Peaches.

00:01:32.101 --> 00:01:33.311
(Peaches cooing)

00:01:33.394 --> 00:01:34.979
He's alive.

00:01:36.564 --> 00:01:37.690
Buck?

00:01:39.150 --> 00:01:41.235
I... I gotta...

00:01:42.111 --> 00:01:43.404
Yeah.

00:01:43.488 --> 00:01:44.906
Besides...

00:01:44.989 --> 00:01:48.910
this world should really
stay down here.

00:01:48.993 --> 00:01:51.204
Take care of them, Tiger.

00:01:51.287 --> 00:01:53.915
"Always listen to Buck."

00:01:53.998 --> 00:01:56.167
SID:
We're almost out.

00:01:57.502 --> 00:01:59.045
(sighs)

00:02:00.546 --> 00:02:01.756
Hmm.

00:02:02.965 --> 00:02:05.301
Rudy!

00:02:05.384 --> 00:02:08.513
Whoo... hoo!

00:02:08.596 --> 00:02:11.224
Whoo!

00:02:15.937 --> 00:02:17.271
(gasps)

00:02:20.691 --> 00:02:22.318
(rumbling)

00:02:22.401 --> 00:02:23.402
(grunts)

00:02:23.486 --> 00:02:25.822
(sighs)

00:02:25.905 --> 00:02:27.114
Is everybody okay?

00:02:28.199 --> 00:02:30.368
Where's Buck?

00:02:32.119 --> 00:02:33.830
Don't worry.

00:02:33.913 --> 00:02:36.833
He's where he wants to be.

00:02:36.916 --> 00:02:38.376
Is he going to be okay?

00:02:38.459 --> 00:02:39.710
DIEGO:
Are you kidding?

00:02:39.794 --> 00:02:41.254
Nothing could kill that weasel.

00:02:41.337 --> 00:02:43.005
It's Rudy I'm worried about.

00:02:43.089 --> 00:02:45.132
(Peaches cooing)

00:02:47.969 --> 00:02:49.720
(giggling)

00:02:54.851 --> 00:02:59.438
I know this "baby makes three" thing
isn't for you, but...

00:02:59.522 --> 00:03:01.482
well, whatever you decide to do...

00:03:01.566 --> 00:03:03.359
I'm not leaving, buddy.

00:03:03.442 --> 00:03:05.069
Life of adventure?

00:03:05.152 --> 00:03:06.320
It's right here.

00:03:06.404 --> 00:03:07.905
But I got a...
I got a whole speech here.

00:03:07.989 --> 00:03:09.991
I-I've been working on it.

00:03:10.074 --> 00:03:13.369
How can I show you that
I'm... strong and sensitive?

00:03:13.452 --> 00:03:14.996
Noble yet caring?

00:03:15.079 --> 00:03:15.913
Ow.

00:03:17.164 --> 00:03:18.916
Thanks.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:21.460
(laughing, whooping)

00:03:21.544 --> 00:03:22.879
Hoo!

00:03:22.962 --> 00:03:24.505
(squeals, laughs)

00:03:24.589 --> 00:03:25.506
Whoa-ho-ho!

00:03:25.590 --> 00:03:26.966
(muffled grunt)

00:03:28.259 --> 00:03:30.136
-(curious groan)
-(laughs)

00:03:30.219 --> 00:03:31.637
(both laughing)

00:03:32.972 --> 00:03:35.433
Ah, they grow so fast, huh?

00:03:35.516 --> 00:03:37.101
Yeah, I mean, look at my kids.

00:03:37.184 --> 00:03:40.229
It seems like they were born one day,
and then gone the next.

00:03:40.313 --> 00:03:41.772
They were, Sid.

00:03:41.856 --> 00:03:44.317
Yeah. That was a lot of work.

00:03:47.695 --> 00:03:49.906
(Peaches cooing)

00:03:50.990 --> 00:03:52.617
(soft grunts)

00:03:52.700 --> 00:03:54.118
(sneezes)

00:03:54.201 --> 00:03:55.870
(giggles)

00:03:55.953 --> 00:03:57.538
That's right, sweetheart.

00:03:57.622 --> 00:04:00.041
Welcome to the Ice Age.

00:04:00.124 --> 00:04:03.127
(babbling)

00:04:07.924 --> 00:04:10.885
♪ ♪

00:04:10.968 --> 00:04:13.095
(tinkling)

00:04:16.098 --> 00:04:17.892
Yee-hah!

00:04:17.975 --> 00:04:20.144
(roaring)

00:04:21.270 --> 00:04:23.481
BUCK:
Ya, ya, ya, hyah!

00:04:27.276 --> 00:04:30.279
(grunting)

00:04:30.363 --> 00:04:32.323
(straining)

00:04:32.406 --> 00:04:33.908
(panting)

00:04:34.659 --> 00:04:35.534
Mm-mm.

00:04:35.618 --> 00:04:36.702
Mm!

00:04:36.786 --> 00:04:38.120
Oh...

00:04:39.455 --> 00:04:40.748
(groans)

00:04:40.831 --> 00:04:43.167
(strained grunting)

00:04:47.213 --> 00:04:48.547
Hmm...?

00:04:48.631 --> 00:04:50.216
Hmm...

00:04:50.299 --> 00:04:51.717
Ah.

00:04:51.801 --> 00:04:53.803
(frustrated groan)

00:04:53.886 --> 00:04:56.263
(strained grunting)

00:04:56.347 --> 00:04:58.057
(sniffs)

00:04:58.140 --> 00:04:59.058
(gasps)

00:04:59.141 --> 00:05:00.893
(chitters, sniffs)

00:05:00.977 --> 00:05:03.270
(romantic music plays)

00:05:03.354 --> 00:05:04.480
(sighs)

00:05:05.439 --> 00:05:06.315
(gasps)

00:05:10.194 --> 00:05:12.029
(panting, yelping)

00:05:13.739 --> 00:05:16.617
♪ ♪

00:05:20.246 --> 00:05:22.206
(quiet, echoing bounce)

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:24.250
(grunts)

00:05:25.584 --> 00:05:26.877
(sighs)

00:05:26.961 --> 00:05:29.714
♪ ♪

00:05:29.797 --> 00:05:32.133
(music stops abruptly)

00:05:32.216 --> 00:05:33.134
(whimpers)

00:05:33.217 --> 00:05:34.218
-(grunts)
-(grunts)

00:05:35.428 --> 00:05:36.345
(grunts)

00:05:36.429 --> 00:05:37.388
(goofy gasp)

00:05:37.471 --> 00:05:40.516
(grunting, growling)

00:05:42.768 --> 00:05:44.145
(loud, echoing boom)

00:05:44.228 --> 00:05:45.771
(cracking)

00:05:45.855 --> 00:05:48.691
-(gulps)
-(gas hissing, rumbling)

00:05:48.774 --> 00:05:50.026
(loud explosion)

00:05:50.109 --> 00:05:52.153
(dinosaurs bellowing)

00:05:52.236 --> 00:05:53.988
(screaming)

00:05:55.156 --> 00:05:57.658
(gasping)

00:05:57.742 --> 00:05:59.076
(rumbling continues)

00:05:59.160 --> 00:06:01.454
(loud boom)

00:06:01.537 --> 00:06:04.123
(both grunting)

00:06:04.707 --> 00:06:06.584
(funky music)

00:06:08.627 --> 00:06:10.504
-(chuckles, clicks tongue)
-(music stops abruptly)

00:06:11.005 --> 00:06:12.882
(yells)

00:06:12.965 --> 00:06:14.675
(happy gasp)

00:06:14.759 --> 00:06:16.135
(rumbling boom)

00:06:17.928 --> 00:06:19.221
(grunts)

00:06:19.305 --> 00:06:20.556
(laughs)

00:06:20.639 --> 00:06:21.807
(happy panting)

